Only the CAS modules are vendored (content-addressable store, codec
table, packfiles, tree layer). The VFS layer (vfs.c, vfs-snap.c),
cas-omap, castool, and the optional miniz DEFLATE codec are not used
by boris and are omitted.

v0.2.0 adds sparse references and history pruning (PRUNING.md):
cas_tree_log_truncate bounds a ref's snapshot log, and cas_tree_gc
marking treats missing objects as boundaries instead of errors.
